droidbridge (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial production release of DroidBridge.
  * GTK 4 and libadwaita desktop interface with fallback.
  * Screen mirroring with dynamic preset selection.
  * USB Android audio forwarding via scrcpy 2.0+.
  * Non-blocking GLib process supervisor and device monitor.
  * System diagnostics dialog with redacted export.

 -- DroidBridge Maintainers <packages@droidbridge.org>  Thu, 15 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
